@AGENTS.md

## Claude-specific

A PostToolUse hook installed by the Substrate adapter records each tool call — tool, files, exit status — to a local outbox. It exits in under 2 seconds and, when the server is unreachable, leaves the observation queued locally rather than failing the tool call. Do not disable it.

